                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$g-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• One list of dated items per class: exam, homework, quiz, project. Your current exams carry over.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "n17Jw",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$g-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Each item has a day and an optional time (\"Fri 11:59 PM\").",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kVBt1",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$g-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Tick an item done. Past-due items stay as \"overdue\" until ticked.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C3pDtP",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$g-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Your agent adds them from the syllabus over MCP. You can also add and edit them by hand.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TgzLd",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$g-text-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• New Home page at the top of the sidebar: all classes and all deadlines. The app opens there. Class Overview stays.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "YIC9X",
              "name": "Pick",
